# live-worker-pod — the decision table (family contract in fixture.yaml). The axis is the pod's
# state: a combination of phase, agent container termination state, and sidecar state. Each row
# constructs a pod JSON and asserts the count. The sidecar-held row (Running+agent-terminated) is
# THE FIXED ROW: red on base (the launcher counted it; the scan did not), green after (both now use
# scan semantics: not live).
#
# id                 | world | patch | expect
running-agent-alive  |       |       | 1
running-agent-terminated-sidecar-held |  |  | 0
pending-schedulable  |       |       | 1
pending-unschedulable |      |       | 0
pending-young        |       |       | 1
unknown-phase        |       |       | 1
unset-phase          |       |       | 1
succeeded-phase      |       |       | 0
failed-phase         |       |       | 0
